6, 651, 1499], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[610.0, 1476.0], [650.0, 1476.0], [650.0, 1498.0], [610.0, 1498.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## 幸福生命状态考评奖励办法\n\n（一）奖励对象：在日常生活和工作中主动学习、践行先进生活理念，活出幸福生命状态的胖东来人\n\n（二）考评奖励原则：\n\n1、自由原则：全员可自由选择是否申请考评。申请考评者，根据考评结果得到相应的考评奖励；也可选择不申请考评，不得考评奖励\n\n2、真诚原则：参评者必须保证真诚、真实地学习、践行和评估，禁止弄虚作假\n\n3、公平公正原则：公平公正地评估，不带私心、不带偏见\n\n（三）本奖励实行“自主申请”“先考评，后奖励”的模式\n\n（四）考评内容：生活状态7大模块（爱情、居家、父母、孩子、理财、休假、健康）\n\n（五）考评周期：每季度一次，全年共4次\n\n1、每次最多申请2个模块\n\n（六）考评规则：\n\n2、每个模块一年内只能选择一次，不能重复选择\n\n3、每个模块独立得分、独立核算奖励\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">[14]</div>\n\n\n## 实施流程\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_214_898_1038_1442.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"69%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">[15]</div>\n", "images": {"imgs/img_in_image_box_214_898_1038_1442.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//df5491c1-5ec0-4b46-a898-7e0a975793f0/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_214_898_1038_1442.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A10%3A25Z%2F-1%2F%2F507fd5f36c98a9674ea5a5a8b142272e1d3366a268b265bad11183c6ddd63e9e"}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//df5491c1-5ec0-4b46-a898-7e0a975793f0/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A10%3A26Z%2F-1%2F%2F139ad7e9783710f8d91d2fb1add4c7e5e6f494a6dfc060afb71e9d57594ffea2"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//df5491c1-5ec0-4b46-a898-7e0a975793f0/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A10%3A26Z%2F-1%2F%2Ffd911f4a14494ced9183de4646dfaea588d94bdfa196dbda0b78550e19469e17"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1190, "height": 1684}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-oc